OL,3,GNEWSAEvents on in the West this bank
OL,4,Aholiday weekend
OL,5,
OL,6,FOur record-breaking hot summer may be
OL,7,Fdrawing to a close but here are plenty
OL,8,Fof events to look forward to over the
OL,9,Fbank holiday weekend.
OL,11,FAnd with temperatures a bit more
OL,12,Fbearable, event organisers across the
OL,13,FWest of England will be hoping any
OL,14,Fforecast showers do not put people off
OL,15,Fattending some annual favourites.
OL,17,FFrom live music and family
OL,18,Fentertainment to cultural celebrations,
OL,19,Fhere is a list of what is on over this
OL,20,Fthree-day weekend.
OL,23,APub: 28-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
